# ─── Env vars for EarthContours ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the values. `.env.local` is
# gitignored so your keys stay out of git. In Vercel, set these under
# Project → Settings → Environment Variables.

# CARTO basemaps API key — used for the dark_only_labels and dark_nolabels
# tile overlays on the MAP screen. Get a free key at:
#   https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey/
# Free tier: 5M tile requests/month. Without a key, the Carto overlay passes
# are skipped entirely (the DEM still renders), so the map stays usable but
# unlabeled.
VITE_CARTO_KEY=
